#. module: l10n_ro_anaf_token_online
#: model:base.automation,name:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.automation_anaf_token_receive
msgid "ANAF: SPV token from Terrabit"
msgstr "ANAF: token SPV de la Terrabit"

#. module: l10n_ro_anaf_token_online
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.action_anaf_token_receive
msgid "ANAF: write the SPV token"
msgstr "ANAF: scrie tokenul SPV"

#. module: l10n_ro_anaf_token_online
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.action_anaf_token_authorize
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Generate Token (Terrabit)"
msgstr "Generează token (Terrabit)"

#. module: l10n_ro_anaf_token_online
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.field_res_company__x_l10n_ro_anaf_token_terrabit
msgid "SPV token renewed by Terrabit"
msgstr "Token SPV reînnoit de Terrabit"

#. module: l10n_ro_anaf_token_online
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.field_res_company__x_l10n_ro_anaf_token_terrabit
msgid ""
"The ANAF token of this company comes from the Terrabit server, which renews "
"it."
msgstr "Tokenul ANAF al acestei firme vine de la serverul Terrabit, care îl reînnoiește."

#. module: l10n_ro_anaf_token_online
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ro_anaf_token_online.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"The authorization runs on the Terrabit server, with the digital certificate of the company.\n"
"                        The token comes back here by itself and Terrabit renews it. The first click activates the\n"
"                        service: click again after a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Autorizarea se face pe serverul Terrabit, cu certificatul digital al firmei.\n"
"                        Tokenul se completează singur aici, iar Terrabit îl reînnoiește. Primul clic\n"
"                        activează serviciul: apăsați din nou după câteva secunde."
